From 7c08f43f9f51585ff6de25b15ab3608882b0ae63 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sebastian Matkovich <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:12:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] pro1x_battery: F(x)tec Pro1X battery state of charge

A port of the Pro1X Leste kernel's pro1x-adc-battery: battery voltage
from the PMI632 ADC5, current from the QG fuel gauge, the open-circuit
voltage with a learned internal resistance looked up in the
monitored-battery's OCV table, charge counting pulled towards it while
the current is small. Reported as dev.pro1x_battery.0.* and, for
battery monitors written for ACPI, hw.acpi.battery.* and
hw.acpi.acline.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 sys/conf/files.arm64              |   1 +
 sys/dev/qcom_spmi/pro1x_battery.c | 638 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 639 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 sys/dev/qcom_spmi/pro1x_battery.c

diff --git a/sys/conf/files.arm64 b/sys/conf/files.arm64
index ddf4ca431..754e3e145 100644
--- a/sys/conf/files.arm64
+++ b/sys/conf/files.arm64
@@ -744,6 +744,7 @@ arm64/qualcomm/qcom_cpufreq_hw.c		optional qcom_cpufreq_hw fdt cpufreq
 dev/qcom_spmi/qcom_spmi.c			optional qcom_spmi fdt
 dev/qcom_spmi/qcom_pon.c			optional qcom_spmi fdt
 dev/qcom_spmi/qcom_rtc.c			optional qcom_spmi fdt
+dev/qcom_spmi/pro1x_battery.c			optional qcom_spmi fdt
 dev/qcom_mdio/qcom_mdio_ipq4018.c		optional qcom_mdio fdt mdio mii
 
